{"id":"d7bfcf5788937844","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-sard.md","title":"Sard's Theorem","display":"thm-sard — Sard's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-sard","aliases":["58-thm-sard"],"display":"thm-sard — Sard's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","[[58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-sard"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-sard</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sard — Sard's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"efe8e2f202483a88\" href=\"?note=efe8e2f202483a88\" title=\"58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md\">58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,f,m,n,\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N\\in V\">\\(M,N,f,m,n,\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。固定记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_M=\\langle M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,m\\rangle\">\\(S_M=\\langle M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,m\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_N=\\langle N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n\\rangle\">\\(S_N=\\langle N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CritVal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(f;M,N,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{CritVal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(f;M,N,n)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChartwiseNull}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,N)\">\\(\\operatorname{ChartwiseNull}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,N)\\)</span> 保留原参数表，相对于本次固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_M,S_N\">\\(S_M,S_N\\)</span>；不允许另选一组光滑结构求导。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n^*\">\\(\\lambda_n^*\\)</span> 是 <code>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</code> 构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 维外测度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n^*(B)=0\">\\(\\lambda_n^*(B)=0\\)</span> 表达完整 Lebesgue 测度意义的可测零集，不要求仅在一维测度上解释高维图卡。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"efe8e2f202483a88\" href=\"?note=efe8e2f202483a88\" title=\"58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md\">58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CritVal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(f;M,N,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{y\\in N:\\exists p\\in M\\;(f(p)=y\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}_{58}(p,f,S_M,S_N))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CritVal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(f;M,N,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{y\\in N:\\exists p\\in M\\;(f(p)=y\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}_{58}(p,f,S_M,S_N))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChartwiseNull}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S_N)\\land A\\subseteq N\n\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_N\\;\n\\lambda_n^*(\\psi[A\\cap U])=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChartwiseNull}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S_N)\\land A\\subseteq N\n\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_N\\;\n\\lambda_n^*(\\psi[A\\cap U])=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sard}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,m,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{ChartwiseNull}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{CritVal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(f;M,N,n),N).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sard}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,m,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{ChartwiseNull}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{CritVal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(f;M,N,n),N).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仍断言光滑映射的临界值集为零集；临界性和目标图卡的零测性现有具体内部定义。固定两侧结构避免原三个独立存在结构投影不能确定 df 的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"efe8e2f202483a88","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":